# {{ namespace }}.{{ collection_name }}.example

Starter role for the `{{ namespace }}.{{ collection_name }}` collection. Replace the
placeholder task in `tasks/main.yml` with real content, and the assertion in
`molecule/default/verify.yml` with real checks.

Tested by the collection-level molecule scenario (`make test` from the collection root);
molecule resolves this role by its short name via `ANSIBLE_ROLES_PATH`.
